hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"122","[AI-translation] Haddasana Qutaibah bin Sa'eed, Qaal: Haddasana Ibn Lahi'ah, 'an Abi Yunus, 'an Abi Hurairah, kehte hain: aur maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se khoobsurat koi cheez nahi dekhi, goya ke sooraj unke chehre mein daur raha ho, aur maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se chalte kisi ko tez nahi dekha, goya ke unke liye zameen samet di ja rahi ho. Hum apni jaan thaka lete hain aur wo bilkul mutma'inn hote hain."
